            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CDMom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A luscious and moist chocolate cake and my kids had no clue there was zucchini in it! I squeezed excess moisture out of the zucchini, increased the cocoa to 1/2 cup, added a tsp of salt and adjusted the method to alternate adding wet and dry ingredients to the creamed mixture. I will definitely make it again.",
