              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "bellepepper"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made half of this recipe in an 8” springform pan. I used zucchini I had in the freezer and I had leftover buttermilk, so I used that instead of the milk and vinegar. My version baked for 36 minutes. Great way to use zucchini!",
            "datePublished": "2015-06-20T18:30:48.500Z"
          },
