            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Cheribaby"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I also doubled the cocoa and added extra zucchini. I haven't ever squeezed the zucchini either, I like the moisture it provides to the cake. This is the best chocolate cake ever. I got this recipe years ago before the internet existed. I'd much rather have this cake over any other chocolate cake recipe. Yum!",
            "datePublished": "2017-09-02T19:03:11.370Z"
